---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<Base title="How we work" description="Plan-first, AI-assisted migration: discovery, planning, build, controlled cutover and hypercare.">
  <section class="section on-dark">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">How we work</p>
      <h1>No surprises. No hidden risk. No doubt about who is accountable.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Every migration follows the same repeatable, AI-assisted process, so you always know what is happening, what comes next and how risk is being managed.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <h3>Discover</h3>
          <p>AI-assisted analysis of your existing platform builds an inventory of every interface, map, rule and dependency.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Plan</h3>
          <p>We agree a detailed migration plan: waves, cutover approach, rollback options, owners and success measures.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Build</h3>
          <p>Interfaces are rebuilt on modern Azure integration services, with infrastructure as code and security built in.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Validate</h3>
          <p>Automated tests compare old and new behaviour, so you have evidence before anything goes live.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Cut over &amp; support</h3>
          <p>Controlled release with a rollback path, followed by hypercare until each wave is stable.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section tint">
    <div class="container grid grid-3">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>You stay in control</h3>
        <p>The plan is agreed before work starts. Progress, risks and decisions are visible at every stage.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Risk is managed, not ignored</h3>
        <p>We reduce risk through planning, automated validation, rollback options and controlled cutover, not by promising it away.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Change at your pace</h3>
        <p>Migration speed is usually set by how quickly your organisation can absorb change. We plan around that.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand />
</Base>
